{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19752","headline":"和李使君三郎早秋城北亭宴崔司士因寄关中张评事 · 吕温","name":"和李使君三郎早秋城北亭宴崔司士因寄关中张评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄花古城路，上尽见青山。\n桑柘晴川口，牛羊落照间。\n野情随卷幔，尘事隔重关。\n道合偏重赏，官微独不闲。\n鹤分琴久罢，书到雁应还。\n爲谢登临客，琼林寄一攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}